Modifications made for DeepSeek Harness (2026-11-26):
  - Re-architected visual tokens, palettes (Obsidian, Warm Charcoal, Crystal,
    Alabaster), accent tones, corner styles, and code typography to map onto
    DeepSeek Harness native `--dsw-alias-*` / `--dsw-specific-*` CSS variables
    and `data-ds-dark-theme` theme state.
  - Adapted motion & glow effects (stream text fade-in via CSS Custom Highlight
    API, composer prism aura, conversation ambient aura, smooth caret) to DeepSeek
    Harness DOM hooks (`[data-composer-card]`, `[data-composer-input]`,
    `[data-conversation-region]`, `[data-chat-running]`, `[data-streaming]`).
  - Integrated upstream `vendor/crystal-prism-core.js` (WebGL2 Voronoi
    cut-crystal optics with 2D fallback) into the model-menu reasoning effort
    slider with reactive starfield, light track, and clickable level labels.
  - Integrated `vendor/dual-mascot-rig.js` (pixel mascot stage & micro-ecology)
    onto DeepSeek Harness composer cards.
  - Built DeepSeek Harness host HTTP endpoints for local custom image/video
    wallpaper storage with HTTP Range streaming and durable JSON settings sync.
  - Adapted workbench code-block folding, sticky code headers, and conversation
    turn outline navigation to DeepSeek Harness DOM anchors.
  - Built native DeepSeek Harness Settings section & live Appearance Drawer UI.

